From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: CEB-GNRD board layer <openbmc@localhost>
Date: Sun, 27 Sep 2026 00:00:00 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] ceb-gnrd: add simplified Chinese WebUI locale

Provide a board-owned Chinese locale for the most common WebUI paths. Missing
keys intentionally fall back to en-US so the locale remains compatible with
upstream WebUI additions.

Upstream-Status: Inappropriate [CEB-GNRD product policy]
---
 src/locales/zh-CN.json | 46 ++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++
 1 file changed, 46 insertions(+)
 create mode 100644 src/locales/zh-CN.json

diff --git a/src/locales/zh-CN.json b/src/locales/zh-CN.json
new file mode 100644
index 0000000..4a2d4a1
--- /dev/null
+++ b/src/locales/zh-CN.json
@@ -0,0 +1,46 @@
+{
+  "global": {
+    "action": {
+      "add": "添加",
+      "cancel": "取消",
+      "clearAll": "清除全部",
+      "confirm": "确认",
